'''Bunny''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing it individually for 50 [[coins]] {{Currency|Old Coin}}, or by purchasing the whole bundle during the [[Easter Event 2016|2016 Easter Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is solid white with the head of a bunny imprinted on it, hence the name. The bunny has two long ears with pink in the middle, two small eyes, a tiny pink nose, puffy cheeks, and two buck teeth. The guard is pink, and the handle is solid black.

== Trivia ==
* Bunny is the fourth of the five knives included in the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Easter_Set Easter Set].
* Bunny’s model, published by [[Nikilis]], can be found [https://www.roblox.com/library/387874365/Bunny here].

